The capsule wire format implemented here (six-section record, SHA3-256 over
canonical JSON, Ed25519 signature over the hash hex string, hash-linked chain)
is an independent implementation intended for interoperability. It depends only
on PyNaCl (Ed25519) and the Python standard library.

The browser verifier (explorer/) uses:
  - @noble/hashes  (MIT) — SHA3-256, SHA-512
  - @noble/ed25519 (MIT) — Ed25519 verification
  - Astro, React, Tailwind CSS, motion — see explorer/package.json
